{"text":"purananuru","n":236,"lines":["கலைஉணக் கிழிந்த முழவுமருள் பெரும்பழம்","சிலைகெழு குறவர்க்கு அல்குமிசைவு ஆகும்","மலை கெழு நாட மா வண் பாரி","கலந்த கேண்மைக்கு ஒவ்வாய் நீ எற்","புலந்தனை யாகுவை புரந்த யாண்டே","பெருந்தகு சிறப்பின் நட்பிற்கு ஒல்லாது","ஒருங்குவரல் விடாஅது ஒழிக எனக்கூறி","இனையை ஆதலின் நினக்கு மற்றுயான்","மேயினேன் அன்மை யானே ஆயினும்","இம்மை போலக் காட்டி உம்மை","இடையில் காட்சி நின்னோடு","உடன்உறைவு ஆக்குக உயர்ந்த பாலே"],"tr":["kalaiuṇak kiḻinta muḻavumaruḷ perumpaḻam","cilaikeḻu kuṟavarkku alkumicaivu ākum","malai keḻu nāṭa mā vaṇ pāri","kalanta kēṇmaikku ovvāy nī eṟ","pulantaṉai yākuvai puranta yāṇṭē","peruntaku ciṟappiṉ naṭpiṟku ollātu","oruṅkuvaral viṭāatu oḻika eṉakkūṟi","iṉaiyai ātaliṉ niṉakku maṟṟuyāṉ","mēyiṉēṉ aṉmai yāṉē āyiṉum","immai pōlak kāṭṭi ummai","iṭaiyil kāṭci niṉṉōṭu","uṭaṉuṟaivu ākkuka uyarnta pālē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"potuviyal","tinai_ta":"பொதுவியல்","turai_ta":"கையறுநிலை","poet_ta":"கபிலர்","poet_tr":"Kapilar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"12 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"11×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 44, veṇcīr 3"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 29, veṇṭaḷai 14, kalittaḷai 3"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கலையுணக்","tr":"kalaiyuṇak","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலை","tr":"kalai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுணக்","tr":"yuṇak"}]},{"text":"கிழிந்தமு","tr":"kiḻintamu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிழிந்","tr":"kiḻin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தமு","tr":"tamu"}]},{"text":"ழவுமருள்","tr":"ḻavumaruḷ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழவு","tr":"ḻavu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மருள்","tr":"maruḷ"}]},{"text":"பெரும்பழம்","tr":"perumpaḻam","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரும்","tr":"perum"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பழம்","tr":"paḻam"}]}],[{"text":"சிலைகெழு","tr":"cilaikeḻu